  "details": "Currently there is an issue plaguing quest users only. This issue is that the \"is pose able\" setting for physbones does not work for quest. You are able to enable the settings within unity but when you upload the avatar quest users are unable to pose physbone related objects on avatars. I have avatars that previously had this feature working on quest but after an update that happened about a month ago it no longer works. To be clear PC users are able to pose the physbone related objects and the object poses for quest visually but the quest user is unable to adjust that pose besides just resetting the pose.",
